## 3. Industry-Specific Risk
**Part A — Why This Company Can Compound:**  
Customer demand → CAT’s production expertise and innovation → high-margin parts and services sales → recurring revenue streams that fund R&D and market expansion.  

This virtuous cycle ensures CAT remains a dominant player in heavy machinery, with a focus on sustainability and automation driving long-term growth.  

